# ============================================================
# Scope: the repository ships the path from raw data to a trained,
# deployed model. Manuscript analysis / figure / docx-production
# code and the personal figure-style module stay local.
# ============================================================
plot_styles/
# Reviewer-gap revision work: analysis code and its aggregate outputs. Same rule
# as the src/uti_* scripts above, which this directory had escaped. The outputs
# also held two files that must never be published: a per-sample prediction
# snapshot carrying RAW_INDEX back to the source rows, and a label audit whose
# context column quoted whole paragraphs of the unpublished manuscript.
scripts/
outputs/
src/archive/
src/colab/
src/uti_0[2-9]*.py
src/uti_1*.py
src/uti_2*.py
src/uti_3*.py
